### 1. List all rooms (expect 200, 3 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. Filter by capacity (expect 2 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6

### 3. Filter by keyword (expect 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?keyword=pod

### 4. Both filters (expect 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6&keyword=roof

### 5. One room (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 6. Missing room (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 7. Create (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/4)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rooftop", "capacity": 12 }

### 8. Replace (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Roof", "capacity": 10 }

### 9. Replace missing room (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost", "capacity": 5 }

### 10. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4

### 11. Delete again (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4

### ---------- Week 4 additions ----------

### 12. Capacity 0 is rejected (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Closet", "capacity": 0 }

### 13. Capacity 50 is rejected (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Seminar A", "capacity": 50 }

### 14. Stats: another controller sees the same data (expect {"rooms": 3})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats

### ---------- Week 7: reservations ----------

### 15. Reservations of room 1, ordered by start (expect 200, 3: Mina, Omar, Lucas)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations

### 16. Reservations of a missing room (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations

### 17. Book room 1 (expect 201 + Location: /api/reservations/6)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 18. Overlaps Mina's 10:00-11:00 on 6 October (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 19. Starts exactly when Mina's ends: touching is not overlapping (expect 201 + /api/reservations/7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00" }

### 20. End before start (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-15T12:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-15T11:00:00" }

### 21. Book a missing room (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-15T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-15T11:00:00" }

### 22. All of Mina's reservations, with room names, in one JOIN (expect 200, 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?reservedBy=Mina

### 23. Delete a room that has reservations (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### ---------- Assignment 5: one reservation ----------

### 24. One reservation, the Location from 17 (expect 200, Kim, room name Seminar A)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 25. Cancel the reservation from 19 (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/7

### ---------- Week 9: dirty checking, validation, ApiError ----------

### 26. PUT room 2, same values (expect 200, console: one select, no update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod", "capacity": 4 }

### 27. PUT room 2, new values (expect 200, console: select + update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod XL", "capacity": 6 }

### 28. POST room, blank name (expect 400, fieldErrors: name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 5 }

### 29. POST room, capacity 0 (expect 400, fieldErrors: capacity)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Closet", "capacity": 0 }

### 30. POST room, blank name and capacity 50 (expect 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " ", "capacity": 50 }

### 31. Missing room (expect 404, "room 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 32. Delete a room that has reservations (expect 409, "room 1 has reservations")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 33. Unknown URL (expect 404, not 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### ---------- Lab E: reservations ----------

### 34. POST reservation, blank reservedBy (expect 400, fieldErrors: reservedBy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "", "startTime": "2026-10-20T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-20T11:00:00" }

### 35. POST reservation, no endTime (expect 400, fieldErrors: endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-20T10:00:00" }

### 36. POST reservation, end before start (expect 400, "startTime must be before endTime")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-20T12:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-20T11:00:00" }

### 37. POST reservation over Mina's 10:00-11:00 (expect 409, already booked)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:15:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T10:45:00" }

### 38. Missing reservation (expect 404, "reservation 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99

### 39. Reservations without reservedBy (expect 400, required parameter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations

### 40. POST room, capacity "ten" (expect 400, not valid JSON)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lab", "capacity": "ten" }

### 41. Wrong type in the path (expect 400, 'id' has the wrong type)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/abc

### ---------- my own ----------

### 42. reservedBy longer than 50 characters (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "ABCDEFGHIJABCDEFGHIJABCDEFGHIJABCDEFGHIJABCDEFGHIJX", "startTime": "2026-10-21T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-21T11:00:00" }

### 43. Delete a reservation that does not exist (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99
